#. translators: %1$s plugin name, %2$s Company abbreviation.
#: ai-for-seo.php:32684
msgid "All data generated through the <em>%1$s</em> plugin remains the intellectual property of the user, provided it does not violate the terms of service. <em>%2$s</em> holds no claims to ownership of user-generated content."
