#: ai-for-seo.php:32681
msgid "IV - Data Ownership, Handling and Lifetime"
msgstr "IV - Dataägande, hantering och livslängd"

#. translators: %s: Company abbreviation.
#: ai-for-seo.php:32677
msgid "I understand that using certain features within the plugin will consume Credits based on the specific feature. If higher-than-expected credit consumption occurs due to user actions, whether intentional or unintentional, Credits cannot be refunded or reversed unless %s determines the user was not responsible. However, the right to a 100%% refund within the 14-day money-back guarantee period still applies under these circumstances."
